Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 15:02:58 -0900
Subject: [PATCH 5/6] coop: a portable kit reads only its own nx2_switches.txt

Fritchii reads nx2_switches.txt beside the exe and then the player's one in
%APPDATA%\fritchii (v5.8; eden before). An OoT co-op kit is portable
(user\ beside lichii.exe) and must stay apart from the player's normal
install, so with LICHII_COOP and portable mode the player's switch file is
the kit's own user\nx2_switches.txt and there is no old eden file. That one
place covers every user of the file since v6: the start's reading, the 6.2
EDEN_HYBRID_CORES rewrite and Tools > Switches (open, load, save).
---
 src/yuzu/main.cpp | 14 ++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 14 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/yuzu/main.cpp b/src/yuzu/main.cpp
index 42d2b18dce..4efc647049 100644
--- a/src/yuzu/main.cpp
+++ b/src/yuzu/main.cpp
@@ -379,6 +379,14 @@ bool Nx2IsTestSwitch(std::string_view name) {
 
 // The player's switch file, in Fritchii's data folder: the one Tools > Switches writes.
 std::filesystem::path Nx2UserSwitchFile() {
+#ifdef LICHII_COOP
+    // OoT co-op: a portable kit (user\ beside the exe) keeps the player's switch file in its own
+    // data folder, never the normal install's (%APPDATA%\fritchii or eden): the kit stays apart
+    // from it, for reading, the 6.2 EDEN_HYBRID_CORES rewrite and Tools > Switches alike.
+    if (Common::FS::IsPortableMode()) {
+        return Common::FS::GetEdenPath(Common::FS::EdenPath::EdenDir) / "nx2_switches.txt";
+    }
+#endif
 #ifdef _WIN32
     const auto app_data = Common::FS::GetAppDataRoamingDirectory();
 #else
@@ -390,6 +398,12 @@ std::filesystem::path Nx2UserSwitchFile() {
 // Before the first launch's import has copied it, the player's file is still in the old folder
 // (Fritchii v5.8 moved from eden to fritchii): read, never written.
 std::filesystem::path Nx2LegacyUserSwitchFile() {
+#ifdef LICHII_COOP
+    // A portable kit has no old eden folder to read from (an empty path: never there).
+    if (Common::FS::IsPortableMode()) {
+        return {};
+    }
+#endif
     return Nx2UserSwitchFile().parent_path().parent_path() / EDEN_LEGACY_DIR / "nx2_switches.txt";
 }
 
